# Panel motion

Sheets, menus, dropdowns, accordions, and other panels open, close, and move in **150ms**.

## Source of truth

| Need | Use |
|------|-----|
| Duration (ms) | `PANEL_TRANSITION_MS` from `src/theme/motion.ts` |
| Reanimated `withTiming` / configs | `panelTransitionTiming` from `src/theme/motion.ts` |

## Applies to

- Bottom sheets (`AppBottomSheet` and any sheet built on it)
- Menus and dropdowns (e.g. `OptionsMenuDropdown`)
- Accordion expand / collapse
- Any future overlay panel that appears, dismisses, or repositions

## Does not apply to

- Page / pager slides — use `slideTransitionTiming` (`SLIDE_TRANSITION_MS`)
- Scroll edge fades — keep `ScrollFadeView` local timing
- Small content reveals (e.g. session total) — not panels

## Rules

- Do not hardcode panel durations (including `150`) in components
- Do not use RN `Modal` for menus/dropdowns — presentation blocks touches briefly after open; use an absolute overlay with `panelTransitionTiming`
- Do not use RN `Modal` `animationType="fade"` / `"slide"` for panels — system timing is slower; use `animationType="none"` plus Reanimated with `panelTransitionTiming` only when a true Modal is required
- Bottom sheets: pass `panelTransitionTiming.duration` into `useBottomSheetTimingConfigs`
